=== File Organizer ===

# File Organization Analysis & Recommendations

## 1. Suggested Folder Structure

```
Root/
├── Work/
│   ├── Reports/
│   │   └── Q1_2026/
│   ├── Projects/
│   │   └── Active/
│   ├── Meetings/
│   └── Finance/
├── Personal/
│   ├── Photos/
│   │   └── Vacations/
│   └── Documents/
└── Archive/
    └── 2026/
```

## 2. File Categorization Rules

| Category | Files | Location | Criteria |
|----------|-------|----------|----------|
| **Work Reports** | report_q1.pdf | Work/Reports/Q1_2026/ | Business documents, time-sensitive |
| **Projects** | project_code.zip | Work/Projects/Active/ | Development, code, active work |
| **Finance** | budget_2026.xlsx | Work/Finance/ | Budget, financial planning |
| **Meetings** | meeting_notes.docx | Work/Meetings/ | Notes, discussions, decisions |
| **Personal Media** | vacation_photos.zip | Personal/Photos/Vacations/ | Non-work images, personal use |

